---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Share a Testimonial | Pikes Peak Web Designs"
description: "Leave a testimonial for Pikes Peak Web Designs. I read every one, and with your permission, the best ones appear on the Samples page."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Share a testimonial</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="section-label">Testimonials</span>
    <h1>Tell me how it went, <em>and help another owner decide</em></h1>
    <p>If working with me has been good for your business, a short note helps me a lot. With your permission, it may also help another small business owner feel confident choosing me.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:720px">
    <div class="contact-form-card">
      <h2 class="form-heading">Share your experience</h2>
      <p class="form-intro">There are four short prompts, and one or two sentences each is plenty. You control what's public, and I never publish anything without your clear yes.</p>

      <form data-web3forms data-redirect="/thank-you/?type=testimonial" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="form">
        <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="b6c3454b-f07c-43f7-9070-0e0cb5286f55">
        <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New testimonial: Pikes Peak Web Designs">
        <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Pikes Peak Testimonial">
        <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">

        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="fullName">Your name <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="fullName" name="fullName" required autocomplete="name">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="businessName">Business name <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="businessName" name="businessName" required autocomplete="organization">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="role">Your role</label>
            <input type="text" id="role" name="role" placeholder="Owner, office manager, and so on">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="city">City and state</label>
            <input type="text" id="city" name="city" placeholder="Colorado Springs, CO">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="rating">Overall rating <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <select id="rating" name="rating" required>
            <option value="">Choose one…</option>
            <option value="5">5 stars: couldn't be happier</option>
            <option value="4">4 stars: very good, with minor notes</option>
            <option value="3">3 stars: okay, but could be better</option>
            <option value="2">2 stars: it was a struggle</option>
            <option value="1">1 star: wouldn't recommend</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="qBefore">What wasn't working before? <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <textarea id="qBefore" name="qBefore" rows="3" placeholder="What was your website like before we worked together? A slow site? No site? Stuck on a builder you'd outgrown? One or two sentences is plenty." required></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="qWhy">Why did you choose Pikes Peak? <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <textarea id="qWhy" name="qWhy" rows="3" placeholder="What made you choose me over the alternatives? What clicked? Plain words beat polished ones." required></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="qAfter">What changed after launch? <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <textarea id="qAfter" name="qAfter" rows="3" placeholder="Numbers if you have them (calls, leads, rankings). A feeling is fine too: 'I stopped worrying about my website.'" required></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="qAdvice">What would you tell another business owner? <span class="req">*</span></label>
          <textarea id="qAdvice" name="qAdvice" rows="3" placeholder="Picture someone running a business like yours, reading this. What would you tell them?" required></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="quote">Anything else? (optional)</label>
          <textarea id="quote" name="quote" rows="3" placeholder="Free space for a moment, a number, a story, a thank-you, or anything that doesn't fit above."></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label id="publishPermissionLabel">May I publish this?</label>
          <div class="form-radio-group" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="publishPermissionLabel">
            <label><input type="radio" name="publishPermission" value="full"> Yes, with my name, business, and city</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="publishPermission" value="first-name"> Yes, but use only my first name and city</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="publishPermission" value="anonymous"> Yes, but keep me anonymous ("a Colorado contractor")</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="publishPermission" value="no"> No, this is just between us</label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="photoLink">Headshot or business photo link (optional)</label>
          <input type="url" id="photoLink" name="photoLink" placeholder="https://">
        </div>

        <div id="form-error" role="alert" class="form-error">
          Something went wrong. Please try again, or email me at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-full btn-lg">Send testimonial</button>
        <p class="form-hint">Thank you. I read every one.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
